# 约定(2026-09-23 重写, 对齐 api/cart/v1 的 proto):
#   直连 = http://{host}:{port}, 身份由 x-md-global-user-id 头模拟网关注入;
#   网关 = {gateway_scheme}://{gateway_host}(LAN) 或 https://{public_gateway_host}(公网), 带 Authorization: Bearer {token}。
#   变量在 http-client.env.json(dev)。host 用 [::1]: 127.0.0.1:30001/30002/30003 被 GoLand/WebStorm/JCEF 占着。

### healthz
GET http://{{host}}:{{port}}/healthz

### GetCart(空购物车的用户 → isCartEmpty)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/cart.v1.CartService/GetCart
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-user-id: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

{}

### GetCart(seed 用户, 应有 2 项)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/cart.v1.CartService/GetCart
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-user-id: {{user_id}}

{}

### AddProductToCart(会写 dev 库; unitPriceCents 必填 >0)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/cart.v1.CartService/AddProductToCart
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-user-id: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

{
  "spuId": {{spu_id}},
  "skuId": {{sku_id}},
  "merchantId": "{{cart_merchant_id}}",
  "quantity": 1,
  "selected": true,
  "spuName": "http-client 测试商品",
  "skuName": "默认",
  "unitPriceCents": 100,
  "skuAttributes": {"color": "black"},
  "skuThumbnailUrl": "https://cdn.example.com/iphone15pro/main.jpg",
  "status": "CART_STATUS_ACTIVE"
}

### UpdateCartItemQuantity
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/cart.v1.CartService/UpdateCartItemQuantity
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-user-id: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

{"spuId": {{spu_id}}, "skuId": {{sku_id}}, "merchantId": "{{cart_merchant_id}}", "quantity": 2}

### RemoveCartItem(2026-09-23 前直连会 500: pgx 没注册 cart.cart_type[] —— data.go AfterConnect 已修)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/cart.v1.CartService/RemoveCartItem
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-user-id: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001

{"spuIds": [{{spu_id}}], "skuIds": [{{sku_id}}], "merchantIds": ["{{cart_merchant_id}}"], "status": ["CART_STATUS_ACTIVE"]}

### GetCart(LAN 网关)
POST {{gateway_scheme}}://{{gateway_host}}/cart.v1.CartService/GetCart
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{}
